&CONTROL
    calculation = 'scf',
    restart_mode = 'from_scratch',
    prefix = 'si_ecut50',
    pseudo_dir = './pseudo/',
    outdir = './tmp_libro/',
/

&SYSTEM
    ibrav = 0,
    nat = 2,
    ntyp = 1,
    ecutwfc = 50,
    ecutrho = 500,
    occupations = 'fixed',
/

&ELECTRONS
    conv_thr = 1.0d-8,
    mixing_beta = 0.7,
/

ATOMIC_SPECIES
Si  28.085  Si_PBE_USPP.UPF

ATOMIC_POSITIONS crystal
Si  0.00  0.00  0.00
Si  0.25  0.25  0.25

K_POINTS automatic
6 6 6 0 0 0

CELL_PARAMETERS angstrom
0.000  2.715  2.715
2.715  0.000  2.715
2.715  2.715  0.000
